t-images/1782951719608-5oqw4u/thumb.webp"}]'::jsonb);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, nome, sabor, categoria, preco, volume_ml, estoque, notas_aromaticas, descricao, sugestoes, foto_url, ativo, graduacao_gl, brix, pedidos_count, ordem, created_at, updated_at, ingredientes, fotos) VALUES ('b679b884-73a2-48cc-81af-2bc99abecee1', 'Poção da Serenidade', 'Maracujá', 'fino', 35, 750, 3, 'Tropical • Cítrica • Refrescante', 'Notas tropicais vibrantes, equilibranco acidez marcante com doçura.', 'Em coquetéis tropicais (caipirinha de maracujá, mojito). Servir gelado, puro ou com gelo como refresco. Harmoniza com frutas frescas, sobremesas geladas (sorbete, panna cotta) e pratos exóticos.', 'https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782952234711-kyu8fd/card.webp', true, 15, 44, 0, 8, '2026-05-15T20:15:03.142933+00:00', '2026-07-02T00:31:52.652788+00:00', 'Açúcar, Álcool de Cereais e Polpa de maracujá.', '[{"card": "https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782952234711-kyu8fd/card.webp", "full": "https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782952234711-kyu8fd/full.webp", "thumb": "https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782952234711-kyu8fd/thumb.webp"}, {"card": "https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782952238589-r356qc/card.webp", "full": "https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782952238589-r356qc/full.webp", "thumb": "https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782952238589-r356qc/thumb.webp"}]'::jsonb);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, nome, sabor, categoria, preco, volume_ml, estoque, notas_aromaticas, descricao, sugestoes, foto_url, ativo, graduacao_gl, brix, pedidos_count, ordem, created_at, updated_at, ingredientes, fotos) VALUES ('37758861-8dc5-4a9d-8995-b341c91ba200', 'Poção Silvestre', 'Jabuticaba', 'fino', 38, 750, 0, 'Frutada • Adocicada • Leve Acidez', 'Sabores intensos de jabuticaba madura, frutado e aveludado.', 'Servir gelado, puro ou on the rocks. Em coquetéis vermelhos (caipirinha de jabuticaba) ou misturado a espumantes suaves. Combina com sobremesas de frutas vermelhas, chocolates finos e queijos de pasta mole.', 'https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782952230967-czv52h/card.webp', true, 15, 31, 0, 7, '2026-05-15T20:15:03.142933+00:00', '2026-07-02T00:30:53.90902+00:00', 'Açúcar, Álcool de Cereais e Jabuticaba.', '[{"card": "https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782952230967-czv52h/card.webp", "full": "https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782952230967-czv52h/full.webp", "thumb": "https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782952230967-czv52h/thumb.webp"}, {"card": "https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782952235179-nb202x/card.webp", "full": "https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782952235179-nb202x/full.webp", "thumb": "https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782952235179-nb202x/thumb.webp"}]'::jsonb);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, nome, sabor, categoria, preco, volume_ml, estoque, notas_aromaticas, descricao, sugestoes, foto_url, ativo, graduacao_gl, brix, pedidos_count, ordem, created_at, updated_at, ingredientes, fotos) VALUES ('9e6a58a9-8d88-4613-9ce7-2dfb8afca29e', 'Poção Tropical', 'Abacaxi', 'fino', 35, 750, 3, 'Tropical • Doce • Cítrica', 'Fruta tropical que se revela a cada gole, com doçura natural e frescor cítrico.', 'Servir gelado, puro ou on the rocks.  Em coquetéis tropicais (ex: Piña Colada, Margarita). Acompanha pratos leves (frutos do mar grelhados, saladas) e sobremesas tropicais (coco, manga).', 'https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782958376233-9fk474/card.webp', true, 16.5, 20, 3, 1, '2026-05-15T20:15:03.142933+00:00', '2026-07-16T15:32:40.584729+00:00', 'Açúcar, Álcool de Cereais, Polpa de abacaxi e Cravo-da-Índia.', '[{"card": "https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782958373778-oau4jc/card.webp", "full": "https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782958373778-oau4jc/full.webp", "thumb": "https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782958373778-oau4jc/thumb.webp"}, {"card": "https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782958376233-9fk474/card.webp", "full": "https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782958376233-9fk474/full.webp", "thumb": "https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782958376233-9fk474/thumb.webp"}]'::jsonb);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, nome, sabor, categoria, preco, volume_ml, estoque, notas_aromaticas, descricao, sugestoes, foto_url, ativo, graduacao_gl, brix, pedidos_count, ordem, created_at, updated_at, ingredientes, fotos) VALUES ('4a8abdb5-e5d4-4ab6-9fd8-4db419c17ed9', 'Poção do Doce Sossego', 'Maracujá Cremoso', 'cremoso', 45, 750, 8, 'Tropical • Cítrico • Doce', 'Licor cremoso artesanal de maracujá, doce e levemente cítrico. Textura aveludada e sabor tropical, equilibrado e fresco.', 'Bem gelado, realçando frescor e acidez característica. Drinques tropicais: em batidas ou coquetéis (ex. caipirinha de maracujá ou com vodka) para um toque frutado. Com frutas: acompanha saladas de frutas frescas ou torta de maracujá. A combinação reforça o caráter tropical.', 'https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782952310733-bp4nky/card.webp', true, 12.5, 37, 0, 10, '2026-05-15T20:15:03.142933+00:00', '2026-07-16T15:33:45.612427+00:00', 'Açúcar, Álcool de Cereais, Leite condensado e Polpa de maracujá.', '[{"card": "https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782952237810-xo7cfd/card.webp", "full": "https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782952237810-xo7cfd/full.webp", "thumb": "https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782952237810-xo7cfd/thumb.webp"}, {"card": "https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782952310733-bp4nky/card.webp", "full": "https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782952310733-bp4nky/full.webp", "thumb": "https://pldyufxqitpoyutiszhc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/1782952310733-bp4nky/thumb.webp"}]'::jsonb);
